{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/395ffcc2f584f50ab264e95258c01a58.avif?t=1764592419\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help save the kitties from the zombie apocalypse!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 huge maps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 objects to find (cats and zombies) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 special objects (milk bottles) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint system Progress saving </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress reset </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090450/extras/bbf6081f87231d10b1b4995424f4decb.avif?t=1764592419\" width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats VS Zombies is a hidden object game \u2013 the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map and eliminate the zombies. The game is designed in a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to contamination, an epidemic has broken out \u2013 zombies have taken over the entire town and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies \u2013 these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all the zombies and rescue the cats. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hawkeye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090450/b5698cfacdc8addf4519b5af42b869846d44b096.jpg"},{"name":"Hawkeye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4090450/b5698cfacdc8addf4519b5af42b869846d44b096.jpg"